{
  "cypher": "MATCH (p:Person)-[:writtenBy]->(m:Movie)-[:hasGenre]->(g:Genre)
WHERE (
  p.name = "Josh Friedman" OR any(a IN p.aliases WHERE a = "Josh Friedman")
)
AND (
  g.name = "Science Fiction" OR any(a IN g.aliases WHERE a = "Science Fiction")
)
AND any(l IN m.original_language WHERE l = "Na'vi")
RETURN DISTINCT m.name AS MovieName"
  , "rationale": "Searches for movies written by person whose name or alias matches "Josh Friedman", whose genre name or alias matches "Science Fiction", and whose original_language list contains "Na'vi". The query uses UNION of name and alias checks to account for possible mismatches in the database. It returns only the distinct movie names that satisfy all conditions."}
